This crate is an original implementation for nv-rs of the role JohnnyGuitar NVSE plays for
mods (ADR-0016's "later built-ins"). It contains no code of the plugin and no decompiled code,
and none was read for it: it is written from public behaviour and documentation only.

Plugin: JohnnyGuitar NVSE (author carxt and contributors), release 5.25a is the target (the
owner's list had 5.20). Opcode block 0x3100. DLL file name johnnyguitar.dll as seen in the
owner's installation.

Sources used (2026-11-14): the plugin's repository page and README (https://github.com/carxt/
JohnnyGuitarNVSE: the GitHub API reports the licence as LGPL-2.1, the README says LGPLv2.1-only,
and points to its documentation on the GECK Wiki); xNVSE's documented plugin interface. The
GECK Wiki answered the fetch with HTTP 403 (a bot block); no workaround was attempted, so the
command documentation is not yet read and no command is built. A command is built only after
its public documentation is read, with a note beside it of what it was read from.

Licence check: LGPL-2.1-only. Because no code is copied, nothing of it is carried here; the
credit is given for the names and the behaviour this crate follows. The earlier translation of
its corrections of JIP's co-save is in crates/jip (see crates/jip/NOTICE).

Unverified: the plugin name handed to xNVSE (JohnnyGuitarNVSE) and the version number
(525): neither is stated in a public document read so far. They are inert while
ANSWERS_INSTALLED is false.
